  "explanation": {
    "short": "The letters gn are said \"ny\", like \"canyon\": magnus is MAH-nyoos. Before a vowel ti is said \"tsi\": gratias is GRAH-tsee-ahs. The letters qu are said \"kw\": aqua is AH-kwah. The letter x is \"ks\": pax is pahks.",
    "more": "The \"tsi\" for ti only happens before a vowel; in tibi, where ti is followed by b, it is just t and i: TEE-bee. Every vowel is still said clearly."
  },
